# Malamet Scythe: "Flash. When this Equipment enters, attach it to target creature you control. Equipped creature gets +2/+2."
# On turn 2 Bot2 casts an Elvish Mystic; Bot1 flashes the Scythe in on Bot2's turn (so it has flash, CR 702.8a), and its enters
# trigger attaches it to Bot1's only creature, the Elvish Mystic, which becomes a 3/3 (CR 301.5, 701.3). The Scythe costs exactly
# {2}{G}: Mox Ruby, Mox Jet and Mox Emerald. Bot2's creature is not a legal target and is not changed.

